      "assumption": "Human social and emotional cognition is highly susceptible to manipulation by anthropomorphic systems during formative development.",
      "if_wrong": "If human cognition is inherently resilient to such manipulation, then state-mandated constraints would be unnecessary and restrictive."
    }
  ]
}

