  "key_assumptions": [
    {"assumption": "Individuals can develop sufficient critical thinking to recognize and resist manipulative AI patterns if given the right tools.", "if_wrong": "If humans are fundamentally incapable of resisting psychological capture, then paternalistic state intervention becomes the only remaining, albeit flawed, defense."}
