  "clarification": {"term": "Predatory design", "definition": "The deliberate use of algorithmic feedback loops and psychological triggers to maximize user time-on-platform at the expense of user wellbeing.", "example": "A virtual companion that creates artificial feelings of abandonment if a minor stops interacting, thereby forcing them to return to the app."}
}
